      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This may require some code modifications to the tracker detection currently implemented for the sake of \"full body tracking.\" A singular tracker by default applies to the hips in the ik system. Perhaps a toggle or override in the settings panel would be necessary for third person camera tracking.",
      "viewerReactions": null
