  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-11T17:29:39.670Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This suggestion is to allow players to attach the vrc personal camera to a tracked object. Wether this is a puck from HTC or a controller for occulus since occulus supports a third tracked \"object\" controller for mixed reality cameras. It may seem pointless but for streamers people could use this to have a camera that is controlled by a friend for more realistic looking camera work that's not first person.",
